### Login admin (use o ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD do .env na primeira execução)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "AlteraMe@123"
}

### Capturar o token desta resposta e setar @token em http/_env.http
###   @token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login com senha errada (esperado 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "errada1234"
}

### Login com username inexistente (esperado 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "naoexiste",
  "password": "qualquerXY9"
}

### Verificar rate limit (executar 6x rápido — última deve ser 429)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "errada1"
}
